11
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Ah, I can't stop — my heart goes boom boom

12
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
A little devil's rising bloom

13
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.000
just a boy, a boy…

14
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.000
I'll spread my wings in this wild night

15
